@startuml 004-results-view-component
title 004 results-view：組件圖

package "web" {
  [Teacher\n＋ Board（題號 × 組別表）] as Teacher
  [Student\n＋ StudentResults（ended）] as Student
}

package "server/quiz_server" {
  [views.teacher_view\nboard・team_scores（任何階段）] as TV
  [views.student_view\nresults・team_scores（只在 ended）] as SV
  [results\nbuild・team_scores] as Results
  [scoring.ScoringRule] as Rule
  [activity.Activity\nsubmissions・rule] as Act
}

TV --> Results
SV --> Results
Results --> Rule : 排名與分數只經規則
Results --> Act : 讀送出紀錄
TV ..> Teacher : WebSocket 推播
SV ..> Student : WebSocket 推播

note bottom of Results
  老師 board 與學生 results 同源，
  前端不重算順位與得主
end note
@enduml
